[{"answer":"Good afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Mrs Carter","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I run the before and after school extended hours childcare service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you've had a chance to have a good look around the school and talk to staff and pupils.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I know that many of you are interested in using our childcare service","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"when your child joins the school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and perhaps you already know something about it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"but for those that don't, I'll go through the main details now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"We offer childcare for children from the ages of four to eleven","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"both before and after school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I know that many parents who work find this service invaluable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"You can leave your child with us safe in the knowledge that they will be extremely well cared for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"We are insured to provide care for up to 70 children,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"although we rarely have this many attending at any one session.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we generally expect around 50 to 60 children for the afternoon sessions","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and about half that number for the breakfast sessions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Although we currently do have 70 children registered with us,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"not all of these attend every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It's ten years since we began offering an extended hours service","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've come a long way during that time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"When we first opened, we only had about 20 children attending regularly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We try to keep our costs as low as we can","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and we think we provide very good value for money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"For the afternoon sessions, which run from 3:30 until 6 p.m.,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"it's £7.20.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"But if you prefer, you can pay for one hour only,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"which costs £3.50","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"or two hours which costs £5.70.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"The cost of the childcare includes food and snacks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll be given breakfast in the morning","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and in the afternoon, a healthy snack as soon as they finish school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"At 5 p.m. children are given something more substantial,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"such as pasta or a casserole.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Please inform us of any allergies that your child might have","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll make sure they're offered a suitable alternative.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"As you may know,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/36.mp3"},{"answer":"the childcare service runs through the school holidays from 8 a.m. to 6 p.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"We offer a really varied and exciting programme to keep the children entertained,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"we don't want them to feel as if they are still at school!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"It will also feel different","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"because they'll get the chance to make new friends with children from other schools.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Spaces are available for them","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"because a lot of our term-time children don't always attend during the holiday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"In the past,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"parents have asked if children over the age of 11 are allowed to come with their younger brothers and sisters,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm afraid we're unable to do this","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"because of the type of insurance we have.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"So now let me tell you about some of the activities that your child can do during the after-school sessions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"As well as being able to use the playground equipment, computers and the library,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"there is usually at least one 'special' activity that children can do each day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, Spanish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"We have a specialist teacher coming in every Thursday","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"to give a basic introduction to the language through games and songs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"She does two sessions:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"one for the over 8s and one for the younger children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"This is the only activity which we have to make an extra charge for","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/56.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's well worth it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Once a week the children have the opportunity to do some music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/58.mp3"},{"answer":"We're very lucky that one of our staff is a member of a folk band.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/59.mp3"},{"answer":"On Mondays, she teaches singing and percussion to groups of children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/60.mp3"},{"answer":"We do rely on parental support for this,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/61.mp3"},{"answer":"so if any of you sing or play an instrument","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and would be prepared to help out at these sessions, we'd be delighted.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Painting continues to be one of the most popular activities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/64.mp3"},{"answer":"To begin with we weren't keen on offering this because of the extra mess involved,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/65.mp3"},{"answer":"but children kept asking if they could do some art","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/66.mp3"},{"answer":"and so we finally gave in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Art is great for helping the children to relax after working hard at school all day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yoga is something that we've been meaning to introduce for some time","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/69.mp3"},{"answer":"but haven't been able to find anyone available to teach it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/70.mp3"},{"answer":"until now that is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/71.mp3"},{"answer":"So we'll see how this goes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Hopefully, children will benefit in all sorts of ways from this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Cooking is another popular activity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/74.mp3"},{"answer":"They make a different sort of cake, or pizza or bread each week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Although the younger children love doing it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/76.mp3"},{"answer":"we found that the mess was just too much,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/77.mp3"},{"answer":"so we've decided to restrict this to the over 8s,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/78.mp3"},{"answer":"as they are better able to clean up after themselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-2-2022-12-24-21-57-42/79.mp3"}]
